00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.440
Abraham: So, let’s start by
having a recap on some of the

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:05.359
best methods for maintaining
security to refresh your memory.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:09.739
Businesses large and small can use
different methods to maintain cyber

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.879
security to keep their data safe online.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:16.479
These can give a basic level of
security against the most common risks.

00:00:17.469 --> 00:00:21.441
Intrusion detectors can be used to
monitor a system and any unusual activity.

00:00:21.441 --> 00:00:25.305
Also raising awareness of all
employees and their role in

00:00:25.305 --> 00:00:27.237
keeping a business cyber secure.

00:00:27.237 --> 00:00:32.279
As we have mentioned previously, using
strong passwords such as those using a

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:37.109
combination of capital and lower-case
letters, numbers, and symbols and multi

00:00:37.109 --> 00:00:41.440
factor authentication are important
and having a password policy can help

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.350
staff follow best security practice.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:47.129
Controlling access to data by
making sure that individuals only

00:00:47.139 --> 00:00:50.099
have access to data and services
for which they are authorised.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:54.120
This may involve physical restrictions
to certain premises or application

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:58.701
controls limiting access to networks
which we covered in the last unit.

00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:02.849
Firewalls are effective gatekeepers
and a major barrier to cyber threats,

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:06.410
software and firmware updates
should always be kept up with.

00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:10.840
Having suitable anti-malware software
installed and regularly updated is

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.409
essential to protect your system.

00:01:13.199 --> 00:01:17.530
Ensure that data is consistently backed
up using any protected back up devices,

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:21.530
so that if a system is hacked or corrupted
the information can be retrieved.

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:25.190
Remember make sure that your system
is not vulnerable to the risk of cyber

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:29.750
security attack as much as you can, by
being aware of how cyber secure you are.

